#!name=知乎
#!desc=某些APP要清除缓存或者重新安装拦截广告才会生效！
#!author=奶思
#!homepage=https://github.com/fmz200/wool_scripts
#!icon=https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/b4/8d/64/b48d64a1-e72e-9cae-8b20-2721bcb059a9/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-sRGB-85-220.png/100x100bb.png
#!raw-url=https://github.com/fmz200/wool_scripts/raw/main/QuantumultX/rewrite/split/partZ/Zhihu.snippet
#!tg-group=https://t.me/QuantumultXCommunity
